  I know I'll never forget the mysterious, yet ever-so-<br>caring woman I met today.

//　――さようなら。
//　うっかり告げ忘れた別れの言葉を呟く。
  Goodbye.
  I forgot to say it to her face, so I whisper it in my heart.

